  "steps": [
    "Boil 25g soya granules, drain them well and keep them aside.",
    "Wash poha, drain the water and fluff with a fork.",
    "Add the sprouts, green peas and chopped carrot to a pan with some water. Boil until the vegetables are cooked.",
    "Meanwhile, heat 1 tsp oil in a pan and add cumin seeds, mustard seeds, curry leaves and green chilli. Let them sizzle until fragrant.",
    "Add peanuts, pumpkin seeds and finely chopped onion. Sauté until the onion turns slightly golden and everything is fragrant.",
    "Add the boiled soya granules, turmeric powder, red chilli powder and salt. Mix well.",
    "Add the boiled vegetables and poha, then mix everything together. Cook for a few minutes until well combined.",
    "Finish with fresh lemon juice and a little zero-calorie sweetener to balance the flavours.",
    "Garnish with onion and sev."
  ],
